></name><name><surname>Murrell</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Clarke</surname><given-names>RA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Mutations in GDF6 are associated with vertebral segmentation defects in Klippel-Feil syndrome</article-title><source>Human Mutation</source><year>2008</year><volume>29</volume><issue>8</issue><fpage>1017</fpage><lpage>27</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18425797</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><label>11</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group><name><surname>Erlacher</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Ng</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Ullrich</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Krieger</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Luyten</surname><given-names>FP</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Presence of cartilage-derived morphogenic proteins in articular cartiolage and enhancement of matrix replacement in vitro</article-title><source>Arthritis &#x00026; Rheumatism</source><year>1998</year><volume>41</volume><issue>2</issue><fpage>263</fpage><lpage>73</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9485084</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><label>12</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group><name><surname>Bobacz</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Gruber</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Soleiman</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Graninger</surname><given-names>WB</given-names></name><name><surname>Luyten</surname><given-names>FP</given-names></name><name><surname>Erlacher</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Cartilage derived morphogenic protein-1 and -2 are endogenously expressed in healthy and osteoarthritic human articular chondrocytes and stimulate matrix synthesis</article-title><source>Osteoarthritis &#x00026; Cartilage</source><year>2002</year><volume